1
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:04,680
歡迎 你們大多知道我代理副校長塔克的身份
Welcome. Most of you know me as Acting Vice Principal Tucker,

2
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,680
但是今天...
but today...

3
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:09,680
我是你們通往未來的指引者...
I am your guide to the future...

4
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,340
未來... 未來...
the future... the future.

5
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:13,400
好吧 所以你在回音上沒聽我的建議
Okay, so you didn't take my note on the echo.

6
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:15,780
米奇爾 我腦子聽不進更多的負面評論了
Mitchell, I can't take another negative voice in my head.

7
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,540
我已經被布朗校長嚇懵了
I'm already freaking out about Principal Brown.

8
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,280
我有種被校園霸凌的感覺
I kind of have a bully at school.

9
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:22,840
你要把這都吃完嗎
You gonna eat all that?

10
00:00:23,298 --> 00:00:24,668
我 我想不是吧
I-I guess not.

11
00:00:24,668 --> 00:00:25,568
那好
Okay.

12
00:00:25,568 --> 00:00:27,118
看到你關于明天研討會的計劃了
Saw your plans for the seminar tomorrow.

13
00:00:27,118 --> 00:00:29,057
你喜歡嗎 你知道 我覺得孩子們
Oh, you like it? Y-You know, I think the kids

14
00:00:29,057 --> 00:00:31,357
聽一聽四個路途迥異的畢業生的發言
will really benefit from hearing from four graduates

15
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:33,360
一定會感覺獲益匪淺的
that have taken such different paths.

16
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:36,280
他們中有上傳統大學的 也有空檔一年的...
I've got traditional college, gap year --

17
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,400
大錯特錯 我們只推行一條路 上大學
Wrong! We're pushing one path here -- college.

18
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:40,700
行吧 好 但大學才不是
Well, yeah, but college isn't necessarily

19
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,000
對每個人來說的必經...
the right path for every--

20
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,160
塔克 你熟悉"金蘋果"這個詞嗎
Tucker, are you familiar with the term "Golden Apple"?

21
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,820
熟悉啊 我有點驚訝
I am. I'm a little surprised

22
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,280
這個用語進入了普通直男世界
it's made its way into the straight vernacular.

23
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:49,080
這玩法在阿拉巴馬州還是非法的呢
It's still illegal in Alabama.

24
00:00:49,417 --> 00:00:51,527
不不不 金蘋果是個獎項 授予給那些
No, no, no, Golden Apple status is awarded to schools

25
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,900
大學錄取率在60%以上的學校
that reach a minimum of 60% college acceptance.

26
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,500
如果我們不夠 我就得回去在夜校教書了
If we dip below that, I'm back to teaching night school.

27
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:58,300
如果你認為學校的午餐阿姨很兇殘的話
If you think the lunch ladies are mean,

28
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,120
那晚餐阿姨就是殘上加殘了
you should meet the dinner ladies.

29
00:01:00,140 --> 00:01:02,000
行 但其他學生...
Yeah, but what about the students that --

30
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,760
合作[玩球] 代理副校長塔克
Play ball, Acting Vice Principal Tucker,

31
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,340
或許你會發現自己變成了...
and you might just find yourself --

32
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:06,060
副校長嗎
Vice principal?

33
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:10,500
我只是不確定我是不是能說動別人
I just don't know if I can preach something

34
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:11,660
聽信一些我自己都不相信的事情
that I don't believe.

35
00:01:11,776 --> 00:01:13,376
-"合作" -這詞以前沒人用
- Ha! Play ball. - Seems like a thing

36
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,800
現在倒是大紅大紫了
no one was saying, and now everyone is.

37
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:16,020
你知道我在做什么嗎
You know what I'm doing right now?

38
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:17,620
我在做一百個小蛋糕
I'm making 100 cupcakes

39
00:01:17,636 --> 00:01:21,066
因為地檢官孩子派對的承辦人跑了
because the D.A. lost his caterer for his kid's party

40
00:01:21,066 --> 00:01:22,406
他問我能不能幫忙
and asked if I could help out.

41
00:01:22,406 --> 00:01:25,236
但是如果這能讓他對我多加青睞的話
But if it puts me, uh, higher up on his radar,

42
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:26,900
那我就做吧
then so be it.

43
00:01:27,086 --> 00:01:29,586
我只是說有時候你得妥協
I'm just saying sometimes you need to compromise

44
00:01:29,586 --> 00:01:31,146
以退為進
to -- to get ahead.

45
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,580
也許我們的時代到來了
Maybe it's our time now.

46
00:01:32,660 --> 00:01:33,560
我喜歡
Ooh, I like that.

47
00:01:34,215 --> 00:01:36,935
你好 世界 一對強權夫夫正在冉冉升起
Hey, world, there's a new power couple on the horizon.

48
00:01:36,935 --> 00:01:37,475
對
Yeah.

49
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:38,380
小卡和米奇
Cam and Mitch.

50
00:01:38,885 --> 00:01:40,925
卡奇... 不 聽起來好怪
Citch -- No, that sounds weird.

51
00:01:41,135 --> 00:01:41,835
米姆[女士]...
Mam --

52
00:01:41,835 --> 00:01:42,796
以后會想到的
We'll find it.

53
00:01:57,760 --> 00:01:59,860
爸爸 我們的視頻會議快要開始了
Hey, Dad, our video conference is about to start.

54
00:01:59,955 --> 00:02:02,694
我們能快點嗎 我還要出去開銷售會議
Can we make it fast? I have that sales meeting offsite.

55
00:02:02,694 --> 00:02:04,934
所以得穿著戰袍 帶著雪茄
Hence the power threads and box of cigars.

56
00:02:05,084 --> 00:02:07,214
爸爸 現在才上午十點
Whoa! Dad, it's 10:00 in the morning.

57
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,140
我不會咽的
I don't swallow it.

58
00:02:09,340 --> 00:02:11,660
他聞到我身上的酒氣就會放松警惕
He smells it on my breath, he lets his guard down.

59
00:02:11,940 --> 00:02:13,360
只要二十分鐘 他就隨我玩弄
In 20 minutes, I'm taking him

60
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:15,220
把他玩到連"見多識廣"的獄警看到都會臉紅
in a way that would make a prison guard blush.

61
00:02:15,620 --> 00:02:16,820
這是紳士們談生意的方法
It's the way gentlemen do business.

62
00:02:17,084 --> 00:02:20,474
那很抱歉我打擾了您的威士忌雅興
Well, I am sorry to ruin your Glengarry, Glenlivet fun,

63
00:02:20,474 --> 00:02:21,994
但那個會議被取消了
but that meeting got canceled.

64
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:23,700
什么 我還盼著呢
What? I was looking forward to it.

65
00:02:23,740 --> 00:02:25,540
今天早上尼克通過網絡電話把它搞定了
Nick took care of it by Skype this morning.

66
00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:27,380
登錄吧 咱們的會議要開始了
Log on. Our meeting's about to start.

67
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:32,120
好了 我們開始吧
Okay, let's begin.

68
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,100
尼克 咱們關于互動衣柜
So, Nick, where are we

69
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:35,960
語音指令的事情進行到哪一步了
with the interactive closet with the voice prompts?

70
00:02:36,340 --> 00:02:36,940
這里有份樣本
Here's a demo.

71
00:02:37,183 --> 00:02:39,983
用了與克里斯托弗·沃肯[演員]近似的聲音
Went with a Christopher Walken soundalike voice.

72
00:02:40,160 --> 00:02:41,980
預報說...寒冷
Forecast is...chilly.

73
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:43,780
穿上...一些褲子
Put...on some pants.

74
00:02:44,020 --> 00:02:46,380
可能是因為當時我們都喜歡"步入式衣帽間"
I think we all fell in love with the idea of calling it

75
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:48,920
與那個演員名的諧音哏 但這聲音真的不搭
a Walken closet, but this just isn't working.

76
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:51,540
克萊爾 我怎么沒看到你爸來開會呢
Hey, Claire, I don't see your dad on the video conference.

77
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,020
媽的
Damn it!

78
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:54,600
我電腦又壞了
My computer's busted again.

79
00:02:54,700 --> 00:02:56,940
或者你的大寫鎖定又開了
Or your caps lock is on.

80
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:59,100
我們就不能在會議室開會嗎
Can't we have this meeting in the conference room?

81
00:02:59,200 --> 00:03:00,780
我們都圍著桌子坐下
You know, where we all sit around a table,

82
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:02,420
面前擺著豐盛的早餐
there's a nice breakfast spread?

83
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:05,100
我厭倦了總把奶油干酪鎖在抽屜里
I am tired of having to keep cream cheese in my desk.

84
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:06,860
爸爸 你知道我們為什么要這么做
Dad, you know why we do it this way.

85
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:08,340
我們有員工在這里工作
We have people working here.

86
00:03:08,400 --> 00:03:09,700
也有員工在家工作
We've got people working from home.

87
00:03:09,740 --> 00:03:11,780
我們有在世界各地工作的員工
We've got people working all over the world.

88
00:03:12,062 --> 00:03:14,612
蒂芙尼還在柏林的德國衣柜展呢
Tiffany is in Berlin at KlausetSchvarg.

89
00:03:14,612 --> 00:03:15,882
這個展還在啊
They still have that conference?

90
00:03:15,882 --> 00:03:17,572
我還以為在80年代東德衣柜展時期
I thought they shut that down in the '80s

91
00:03:17,572 --> 00:03:20,182
我們用那個毛衣柜把持不同政見者偷運出去后
after we used that sweater hutch to smuggle that dissident out

92
00:03:20,182 --> 00:03:21,912
那個展就從此被取消了呢
during East KlausetSchvarg.

93
00:03:22,620 --> 00:03:24,420
被你發現了 記得說話對著攝像頭說
You're good. Just talk into the camera.

94
00:03:26,052 --> 00:03:28,032
很抱歉剛才的事
Hoo! Sorry about that.

95
00:03:28,042 --> 00:03:30,642
好的 我們的3D打印有沒有進展呢
All right. How about an update on our 3-D printing?

96
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:32,160
我想大家都認識愛德華多吧
I think everybody knows Eduardo.

97
00:03:32,460 --> 00:03:33,200
杰 你倆見面了嗎
Jay, have you two met?

98
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,560
我看不見攝像頭
I can't see the camera!

99
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,660
爸爸 你在...
Dad, you're, uh...

100
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,740
你有點擋住鏡頭了
you're kind of smushed up against it.

101
00:03:38,791 --> 00:03:41,681
你也許應該往后退一點
You might want to just step back a skosh.

102
00:03:41,811 --> 00:03:44,081
使用3D打印機去制造我們的衣柜
Using a 3-D printer to manufacture our closets

103
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:45,580
能增加三倍的收益
will triple revenue.

104
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,780
我聽不到你們說話
I can't hear you!

105
00:03:47,900 --> 00:03:49,600
音量調大 爸爸
Volume up, Dad.

106
00:03:50,821 --> 00:03:51,941
僅在第一年...
In our first year alone --

107
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,120
搞什么鬼
What the hell?!

108
00:03:53,206 --> 00:03:54,761
爸爸 "撤銷" 就...
Dad, "undo." Just --

109
00:03:54,761 --> 00:03:56,471
我知道 我知道
I know! I know!

110
00:03:56,660 --> 00:03:57,260
雙擊
Double-click.

111
00:03:57,541 --> 00:04:00,511
? 生日快樂 ?
♪ Happy birrrthday ♪

112
00:04:00,511 --> 00:04:01,481
? 衣柜先生 ?
♪ Mr. Closet -- ♪

113
00:04:01,481 --> 00:04:02,532
別 別
No! No!

114
00:04:03,081 --> 00:04:05,541
你們自己開這蠢會吧 我要離開這里
Have your stupid meeting! I'm outta here!

115
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,660
瑪格麗特 我要去街對面的公園
Margaret, I'm going to the park across the street.

116
00:04:08,720 --> 00:04:09,440
我去走走
I need a walk!

117
00:04:11,720 --> 00:04:14,620
真是太感謝你幫喬的忙了
Thank you so much for helping out with Joe.

118
00:04:14,860 --> 00:04:16,520
你不會覺得這樣太華麗嗎
You don't think it's too flashy?

119
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:19,020
你說什么呢 你可要上的可是魔術課
What are you talking about? You're taking a magic class.

120
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,340
得表現出你是認真的
You want to show them you're serious.

121
00:04:20,370 --> 00:04:23,740
是魔法師 不是無聊師
It's abracadabra, not abraca-drab-ra.

122
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:27,040
看那邊 公開選角征集令
Look at that! An open casting call.

123
00:04:27,380 --> 00:04:29,740
打擾一下 這是選什么角色
Excuse me, what is this for?

124
00:04:29,940 --> 00:04:32,640
我們在為格倫谷購物中心尋找真實家庭
We are looking for real families to be the new faces

125
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:33,720
當新的代言人
of the Glen Valley Mall.

126
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:35,500
你們都挺不錯 想報名嗎
You guys are adorable. Want to sign up?

127
00:04:35,730 --> 00:04:36,850
我們不是真的是一家
Oh, we're not a-a real --

128
00:04:36,850 --> 00:04:38,340
我們愿意
Oh, we would love to!

129
00:04:38,340 --> 00:04:41,329
這么好的事剛巧趕上了
What a cool and a spontaneous thing to do!

130
00:04:41,740 --> 00:04:43,900
我一個星期前就看到海報了
I saw that poster last week.

131
00:04:43,919 --> 00:04:46,189
讓我想起了很久以前
It kind of reminded me of a long time ago

132
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:47,880
我客串當模特的時候
when I used to do a little modeling.

133
00:04:48,169 --> 00:04:49,439
可能我挺懷念那時候
I guess I miss it.

134
00:04:49,620 --> 00:04:51,420
我把菲爾騙到商場
I tricked Phil into going to the mall

135
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:53,600
因為我知道杰不會和我試鏡的
because I knew that Jay wouldn't do it with me.

136
00:04:53,909 --> 00:04:56,249
來吧 這會很有意思的
Oh, come on, guys. This is gonna be so much fun.

137
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,040
我不確定
I don't know.

138
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,700
我們班的一個小孩拍了止咳糖漿的廣告
This kid in my class did a cough syrup commercial.

139
00:04:59,999 --> 00:05:02,319
現在他總是去教師休息室
Now he's always going to the teachers' lounge

140
00:05:02,319 --> 00:05:03,709
給經紀人打電話
to call his manager.

141
00:05:03,709 --> 00:05:04,959
他最討厭了
He's the worst.

142
00:05:04,959 --> 00:05:06,759
我五點鐘有一節房地產課要上
And I teach a real-estate class at 5:00.

143
00:05:06,759 --> 00:05:08,360
我需要早點過去做準備
I have to show up early to limber up.

144
00:05:09,260 --> 00:05:12,360
我覺得這對喬的自尊大有好處
I think that this could help a lot with Joe's self-esteem.

145
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,420
他這周過得很不順
He's had a rough week.

146
00:05:14,760 --> 00:05:17,540
你知道同齡人怎么對待喜歡魔術的孩子
You know how they treat kids that are into magic.

147
00:05:17,760 --> 00:05:20,120
你告訴他等到了高中就不會那樣了
Oh, you tell him when he gets to high school, that all changes.

148
00:05:20,260 --> 00:05:22,080
我可不想騙他
I don't like lying to him.

149
00:05:22,528 --> 00:05:24,208
你看 我真的不擅長這種事
Look, this isn't really my thing, and I'm --

150
00:05:24,208 --> 00:05:25,518
而且我最近有點生病
I'm feeling a little under the weather.

151
00:05:25,518 --> 00:05:27,088
你不覺得我看起來臉色有點蒼白嗎
Don't -- Don't I look a little pale?

152
00:05:27,088 --> 00:05:29,238
-我們要參加 -太好了
- We will do it! - Great.

153
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:32,440
我們的私人助理會給你們準備好衣服試鏡
Our P.A. Will set you up with wardrobe for some test shots.

154
00:05:32,860 --> 00:05:34,440
你們好 需要我給你們拿點什么嗎
Hey, team. Can I get you anything?

155
00:05:34,758 --> 00:05:36,788
咖啡 水 純凈水還是氣泡水
Uh, coffee? Water? Still or sparkling?

156
00:05:36,788 --> 00:05:38,488
我要氣泡水
Ooh, I-I'd take a sparkling.

157
00:05:38,680 --> 00:05:39,660
這位人才要氣泡水
Talent wants sparkling.

158
00:05:40,318 --> 00:05:41,538
你聽到了嗎 菲爾
Did you hear that, Phil?

159
00:05:41,538 --> 00:05:43,287
他們叫我們人才
They call us talent!

160
00:05:43,287 --> 00:05:45,177
我們別太激動得忘形 我們還是普通...
Let's not get carried away. We're still reg--

161
00:05:45,177 --> 00:05:46,388
我說要氣泡水
I said sparkling.

162
00:05:50,057 --> 00:05:50,847
看起來參加的人
Well, looks like you're gonna get

163
00:05:51,080 --> 00:05:52,260
不少啊 塔克
a pretty solid turnout, Tucker.

164
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,720
現在差不多可以了
Now close the deal.

165
00:05:54,217 --> 00:05:56,207
這是什么 "接啥"
Hey, what is, uh, "Whanex"?

166
00:05:56,300 --> 00:05:58,500
這年頭年輕人版本的"接下來是什么"
It's the way the kids say "What's next?"

167
00:05:58,657 --> 00:05:59,777
你知道 你要想和他們拉近距離
You know, if you want to reach them,

168
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:01,000
就要學習他們的說話方式
you have to learn to speak their language.

169
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:03,120
打印店搞砸了
Massive screw-up at the print shop.

170
00:06:03,177 --> 00:06:05,297
我完全不知道怎么搞砸的
I-I have no idea how it happened!

171
00:06:05,647 --> 00:06:07,397
對沒錯 橫幅上應該寫...
Yeah, that's right. The banner should read...

172
00:06:07,397 --> 00:06:09,247
接啥 好
whanex. Okay.

173
00:06:09,607 --> 00:06:11,248
對 接啥
Yeah, whanex.

174
00:06:11,747 --> 00:06:15,096
歡迎同學們來到第一屆年度"接啥"研討會
Welcome, students, to the first annual "Whanex" seminar.

175
00:06:15,096 --> 00:06:17,736
我們直接步入正題 歡迎今天的座談嘉賓們
Let's, uh, just jump right into it and meet our panelists.

176
00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:21,200
我們邀請了兩位選擇走入大學的優秀青年
We have two bright, young people who chose the college path

177
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,600
還有兩個任性的迷途青年
and two wayward souls

178
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,680
但愿我們能從他們身上吸取教訓
whose mistakes we can only hope to learn from.

179
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:25,920
你們好 海豚隊
Sup, Dolphins?

180
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:34,320
尼克 對我爸早上的事我很抱歉
Nick, I'm so sorry about my dad this morning.

181
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:35,300
-你們好 -沒事的 別想了
- Hi. - Please forget it.

182
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:36,280
我們現在有個更大的問題
We've got a bigger problem.

183
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:39,360
我們需要為虛擬衣柜助手找個新的聲音
We have to find a new voice for the virtual closet assistant.

184
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:41,000
我們考慮 女聲
We're thinking...female.

185
00:06:41,380 --> 00:06:43,320
我自己也在考慮
Yeah, I was wondering about that myself.

186
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:44,380
等一等
Hold on a second.

187
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:47,180
克萊爾有一副好嗓音 又威嚴又誘人
Claire has a great voice -- commanding but alluring.

188
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:49,200
哪有 我可不知道什么
Oh, come on. I don't know about...

189
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:49,840
誘人
...alluring.

190
00:06:50,220 --> 00:06:50,840
你說得沒錯
You're right.

191
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,700
你說得對 我完全能聽出來
You're right. I can totally hear it.

192
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:53,980
大伙 大伙
Guys, guys...

193
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:55,360
你們說得我都不好意思了
...you're embarrassing me.

194
00:06:55,660 --> 00:06:56,820
你的這一面一直藏在哪了
Where have you been hiding this?

195
00:06:57,520 --> 00:07:00,140
半小時內 我給新的智能衣柜錄完了
Within half an hour, I had recorded all the voice prompts

196
00:07:00,140 --> 00:07:02,200
所有的語音指令 然后他們把語音裝入了
for the new smart-closet, and they installed it

197
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,660
辦公室的樣品柜里
in the prototype right in the office.

198
00:07:03,660 --> 00:07:07,380
大家都很高興 但是我不是很理解
Everyone seemed really happy, but I don't get it.

199
00:07:07,860 --> 00:07:08,300
我是說
I mean...

200
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,160
聲音就是聲音而已
...A voice is just a voice.

201
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,500
太好了 爸 你回來了
Oh, good. Dad, you're back.

202
00:07:14,760 --> 00:07:18,180
請移步我們的新型智能樣品衣柜里
Please step into our new smart-closet prototype.

203
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:20,620
方便你罵我上午不參加會議嗎
So you can yell at me for bailing on the meeting this morning?

204
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:21,740
進去就知道了
Just -- You'll see.

205
00:07:24,700 --> 00:07:26,380
我能幫你選件外套嗎
May I help choose an outfit for you?

206
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,720
因為我是那種還在
Cause I'm some old fossil

207
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,340
穿西裝上班的老古董嗎
that still puts on a suit to go to work?

208
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:30,720
讓我們重新開始
Let's start over.

209
00:07:30,940 --> 00:07:31,620
來就來
Why don't we?!

210
00:07:31,620 --> 00:07:33,980
你想要哪種程度的舒適感
What level of comfort are you looking for?

211
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,460
跟我過去四十年一模一樣的那種
Same thing I've had for the last 40 years --

212
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:39,340
一個能時不時和真人交流的辦公場所
a workplace where you interact with actual people

213
00:07:39,340 --> 00:07:41,420
就像我們現在這樣
every once in a while, like we're doing right now.

214
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,200
我以前很喜歡銷售電話
I used to love sales calls.

215
00:07:43,200 --> 00:07:44,440
現在我們都不這樣推銷了
Now we don't even do them anymore.

216
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,120
我的意思是 你換位思考一下
I mean, put yourself in my shoes.

217
00:07:46,274 --> 00:07:47,523
正裝還是休閑
Dress or casual?

218
00:07:47,523 --> 00:07:49,152
為什么你聽起來像勞倫·白考爾[老明星]
Why do you sound like Lauren Bacall?!

219
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:50,420
我聽不明白
I don't understand.

220
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:51,700
對 因為現在 就像所有的東西一樣
Right, because now, like everything,

221
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,360
我說的梗也過時跟不上你們了
my references are old and out of step.

222
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,540
你為什么在吼
Why are you yelling?

223
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,400
你現在還不懂的話 你永遠都不會懂了
If you don't get it by now, you're never gonna get it!

224
00:07:56,603 --> 00:07:59,103
有人又玻璃心了[內褲卡屁股]
Well, somebody's panties are in a bunch.

225
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:01,340
我可以再幫您準備一條嗎
May I offer you a different pair?

226
00:08:02,020 --> 00:08:02,860
聽起來好詭異
That's just weird.

227
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:07,480
太好了
Ooh! Very good.

228
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,560
我有一個小時給我老板兒子的派對
I had an hour to make 100 cupcakes...

229
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,720
準備一百個小蛋糕
...for my boss's son's party,

230
00:08:12,740 --> 00:08:14,340
但是這一切都是值得的
but it was all gonna be worth it.

231
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,660
他一定會很感激
He was gonna be so grateful,

232
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:18,100
下個升職的就是我
the next big promotion would be mine.

233
00:08:18,220 --> 00:08:19,480
你這個忘恩負義的混蛋
You ungrateful monster!

234
00:08:20,312 --> 00:08:22,242
親姐妹卻有不同的人生軌道
Two sisters, two paths.

235
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:23,840
畢業
Graduation...

236
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:24,900
生育
procreation.

237
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,040
一個掌控一切
The world on a string --

238
00:08:27,462 --> 00:08:29,112
一個未婚先孕
a baby and no ring.

239
00:08:30,132 --> 00:08:32,322
你說你為我而高興
Uh, you -- you said you were happy for me.

240
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:34,420
你說孩子會為我帶來無窮的樂趣
You said a baby would bring me limitless joy.

241
00:08:34,520 --> 00:08:35,620
以及很窮的生活啊
And a limited bank account.

242
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:37,200
現在 曼尼 沒有人懷疑
Now, Manny, no one can doubt

243
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,020
藝術學位在現實世界的價值
the real-world value of an art degree,

244
00:08:39,020 --> 00:08:41,100
但說點令人激動的日常東西吧
but talk a little bit about the exciting social scene.

245
00:08:41,220 --> 00:08:43,760
這么問真有趣 我有天晚上
It's funny you ask -- I went to a wine and cheese mixer

246
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,980
去院長家參加美酒與起司晚會
at the Dean's house the other night.

247
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:47,420
他收集原住民的樂器
He collects instruments of indigenous people.

248
00:08:47,642 --> 00:08:50,501
我們喝完最后一點濃郁的仙粉黛酒后
And by the time we killed the last bit of a chewy Zinfandel,

249
00:08:50,501 --> 00:08:53,551
我們演奏的原住民樂器更像原住民"越氣"了
our jam sesh started to sound like a didgeri- don't.

250
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:55,660
謝謝
Thank you.

251
00:08:55,660 --> 00:08:57,680
我能從這接著說嗎
Could I please pipe in here?

252
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:58,880
好的 請 這是艾麗克斯
Yes, please. Alex.

253
00:08:59,260 --> 00:09:00,420
我真的很感謝
I genuinely appreciate

254
00:09:00,420 --> 00:09:02,080
能有機會再回來
the opportunity to come back here,

255
00:09:02,080 --> 00:09:05,440
這個我曾是畢業致辭的代表的學校
where I had the pleasure of serving as co-valedictorian,

256
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:07,420
為被排斥的成績好的學生
to offer a message of hope

257
00:09:07,420 --> 00:09:11,200
帶來了希望 真的很開心
to those oft-marginalized overachievers out there.

258
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:15,040
我看見你們了
I...see...you.

259
00:09:16,171 --> 00:09:18,711
不是我一個人起了雞皮疙瘩吧
Well, I can't be the only one with goose bumps in here.

260
00:09:18,711 --> 00:09:19,961
請原諒我
Oh. Excuse me. Oh.

261
00:09:20,260 --> 00:09:22,140
好的 歡迎大家提問
Yes, let's open it up for questions.

262
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:23,360
前排那位 請
Right here in the front row. Go ahead.

263
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,730
我還是不懂"接啥"
I still don't get "Whanex."

264
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:27,700
聽起來像我祖父母在俄勒岡的長途電話公司
It sounds like my grandparents' long-distance carrier in Oregon.

265
00:09:28,540 --> 00:09:30,180
好的 你知道嗎 我得接這個電話
Okay, okay. You know what? I have to take this.

266
00:09:30,180 --> 00:09:32,030
盧克 海莉 說說
Uh, Luke, Haley, talk a little bit

267
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,860
你們還住在父母家的感受吧
about how you still live at home with your parents.

268
00:09:35,400 --> 00:09:36,320
怎么啦
Hey, what's up?

269
00:09:36,380 --> 00:09:37,320
我還沒結束呢
I'm in the middle of my thing.

270
00:09:37,880 --> 00:09:38,820
別聽我之前說的合作
Flip what I said before.

271
00:09:38,860 --> 00:09:40,080
夸你想夸的傻蛋二人們吧
Start talking up the dummies.

272
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:40,880
什么
What?

273
00:09:41,170 --> 00:09:43,120
我剛收到工作上的一條短信
Um, I just got a text from work.

274
00:09:43,220 --> 00:09:45,500
我老板把那個大案子給別人了
My boss gave that big case to someone else!

275
00:09:45,610 --> 00:09:46,770
同時 我還在
Meanwhile, I'm still on the hook

276
00:09:46,780 --> 00:09:48,760
弄這些可惡的紙杯蛋糕
for these stupid cupcakes!

277
00:09:49,930 --> 00:09:52,400
我的心跳很快 我的手沒知覺了
M-My heart is racing, my -- my hands are numb.

278
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:55,269
而且我感覺要被空氣傳染糖尿病了
Plus, I-I think I have a case of airborne diabetes!

279
00:09:55,269 --> 00:09:56,829
等下 你是說我應該
Wait. Are you saying I-I should --

280
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:59,120
如果這些大學應用數據下降
Look, if those college application numbers fall,

281
00:09:59,580 --> 00:10:00,740
布朗校長就會被開除
Principal Brown, he gets fired.

282
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:03,060
猜猜接下來是會當 塔克校長
Guess who's up next. Principal Tucker.

283
00:10:04,480 --> 00:10:06,300
我從來不敢這么想
I've never dared dream of such a thing.

284
00:10:06,480 --> 00:10:07,220
更高的薪水
More money,

285
00:10:07,260 --> 00:10:08,740
更好的停車位
better parking space,

286
00:10:09,069 --> 00:10:10,859
而且舞會主題將由你挑選
plus you get to pick the prom theme.

287
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:13,709
我終于能實現我的魔法湖心會主題了
I can finally make my Enchanted Bayou a reality.

288
00:10:13,719 --> 00:10:15,539
好的 回聊
Okay, t-talk -- talk soon.

289
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,940
藝術學校最棒的是
What's great about art school

290
00:10:16,940 --> 00:10:19,060
有很多老師都在行業工作
is that a lot of the faculty work in the industry.

291
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:20,680
我的電影研究教授
My film studies professor

292
00:10:20,680 --> 00:10:23,020
帶我們參觀了所有的大制片廠
has led tours at every major studio.

293
00:10:23,319 --> 00:10:24,918
好的 謝謝 曼尼
All right, thank you, Manny.

294
00:10:24,918 --> 00:10:26,658
對于那些還醒著的各位
And for those of you still awake,

295
00:10:26,658 --> 00:10:29,458
我認為我們今天都學到了 大學...
I think what we've learned here today is -- college,

296
00:10:29,900 --> 00:10:31,080
就是個死胡同
a dead end.

297
00:10:34,940 --> 00:10:36,360
好了 下一個
Okay, up next.

298
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:38,520
菲利普 歌洛莉亞 喬
Philip, Gloria, and Joe.

299
00:10:38,940 --> 00:10:39,640
同樣的場景
Same setup.

300
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:41,960
爸爸和兒子玩接投球 媽媽擺放餐具
Dad playing catch with his son. Mom laying out a picnic.

301
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:44,080
好的 自然點 就像我不在這里
So, just real natural. Like I'm not even here.

302
00:10:44,100 --> 00:10:45,800
沒問題
You got it.

303
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,480
別這么性感
Maybe not so sexy.

304
00:10:49,660 --> 00:10:50,160
我的失誤
My bad.

305
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,360
他在和媽媽說話
He was talking to Mom.

306
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:53,700
你就用正常的方式擺食物
You can just lay out the food in a normal way.

307
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,840
收到 不會再這么出眾了
Copy that. No divas here.

308
00:10:58,100 --> 00:10:59,640
她的頭也很奇怪
Her head is doing something weird.

309
00:10:59,700 --> 00:11:00,600
我們能直點嗎
Can we straighten that up?

310
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:01,880
等下 各位
Hang on, guys.

311
00:11:04,060 --> 00:11:05,380
他們為什么在竊竊私語
Why are they whispering?

312
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,240
是因為我們太老夫少妻感嗎
You think I look too young for you?

313
00:11:07,277 --> 00:11:08,787
為什么 我的魚尾紋很明顯嗎
Why? Are my crow's feet showing?

314
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:10,820
我就知道化妝師遮瑕用太少
I knew makeup was going too light on the concealer.

315
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:12,840
各位 我們今天就混著搭配下試試
Guys, we're just mixing and matching today,

316
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:14,880
所以我們考慮換掉你們其中一個
so we're thinking about swapping out one of you.

317
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,240
不 我們是一個組的
No, we're a team.

318
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:18,640
我們進退一致
You get rid of one of us, and you lose all of us.

319
00:11:18,740 --> 00:11:19,440
是那個小孩
It's the kid.

320
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:20,040
好的
Okay.

321
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,480
我還以為這是為了喬呢
I thought this was supposed to be for Joe.

322
00:11:23,860 --> 00:11:25,480
很明顯 他太差了
Obviously, he's terrible at it,

323
00:11:25,497 --> 00:11:28,056
那怎么能幫助提升他的自尊心呢
so how is that gonna help him with his self-esteem?

324
00:11:28,100 --> 00:11:29,220
你好 我是泰勒
Hi, I'm Tyler.

325
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,500
不妙
Oh, this is not good.

326
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:32,700
泰勒 可能很快要說再見了
Tyler, don't get too comfortable.

327
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,300
我覺得我們需要試點不同的
I think we want to try something different.

328
00:11:34,306 --> 00:11:35,886
-肖恩 你能過來下嗎 -好的
- Hey, Sean, could you step up here? - Yep.

329
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,100
對不起 菲爾
I'm so sorry, Phil.

330
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,800
不 我們想試下兩個爸爸
No, we want to look at two dads.

331
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:40,880
我不能扮演孩子啊
I can't play the kid.

332
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,220
看來你出局了 我們走
Looks like you're out. Here we go.

333
00:11:42,436 --> 00:11:43,396
-肖恩 對吧 -沒錯 嗨
- Sean, was it? - Yeah. Hey.

334
00:11:43,396 --> 00:11:44,437
-你好嗎 -還不錯
- How are you? - Good.

335
00:11:44,940 --> 00:11:47,300
感受不到化學反應
Hmm. Not feeling that chemistry.

336
00:11:47,620 --> 00:11:48,520
或者我們應該接吻
Maybe we should kiss?

337
00:11:48,620 --> 00:11:50,320
我們還是等他們指示吧
We could just wait for them to tell us what to do.

338
00:11:50,386 --> 00:11:53,406
讓我們試下肖恩和一個媽媽
Let's try Sean and a mom.

339
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:53,960
走開 菲爾
Move, Phil.

340
00:11:54,140 --> 00:11:55,280
不 我們指的是莉迪亞
No, we meant Lydia.

341
00:11:58,100 --> 00:11:59,860
好的 差不多了
All right, almost there.

342
00:12:00,080 --> 00:12:01,920
喬 你過來試試
Hey, Joe, hop up here for me.

343
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:06,520
太棒了 這就是我們的一家人了
Yes! That's our family.

344
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:08,560
這就是我們格倫谷購物中心的新面孔
The new faces of Glen Valley Mall.

345
00:12:08,860 --> 00:12:10,520
其他人可以離開了 謝謝
Everyone else can go. Thank you.

346
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:12,520
很高興和你們合作
Nice working with you guys.

347
00:12:12,660 --> 00:12:14,920
我在城另一邊還有個試鏡
I have an audition across town.

348
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:15,800
什么試鏡
For what?

349
00:12:16,155 --> 00:12:17,556
他們需要成年人嗎
Do they need grownups?

350
00:12:19,305 --> 00:12:21,755
我們已經聽乖乖上大學的羔羊們說了很多
Alright, we've heard from our college-going sheep.

351
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:24,720
盧克 你明智地選擇空檔一年
Now, Luke, you wisely took a gap year,

352
00:12:24,795 --> 00:12:26,685
找了份工作 賺了超多錢
got a job, made mad stacks,

353
00:12:26,740 --> 00:12:28,020
還稍微做了投資對嗎
and invested a little, correct?

354
00:12:28,285 --> 00:12:31,804
沒錯 我持有300微盧幣
Totally. I own 300 microrubels,

355
00:12:31,804 --> 00:12:33,784
這是我在臉書上聽說的加密貨幣
a Russian cryptocurrency I heard about on Facebook,

356
00:12:33,784 --> 00:12:35,694
目前只能用于購買一種
which currently, you can only use to buy

357
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:37,580
叫弗蘭肯斯坦的車臣派對毒品
a Chechen party drug called Frankenstein.

358
00:12:37,714 --> 00:12:39,135
好吧 海莉
Okay, Haley, uh...

359
00:12:39,240 --> 00:12:41,880
有性感男友 有工作 準媽媽
hot boyfriend, job, baby on the way --

360
00:12:41,920 --> 00:12:44,600
感覺你人生圓滿 而你選擇的道路
You seem to have it all, yet you took a very different path

361
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:45,680
和你姐姐艾麗克斯很不一樣
than your older sister, Alex.

362
00:12:45,794 --> 00:12:47,654
-我是妹妹 -是嗎 好吧
- I'm younger! - Oh, wow. Okay.

363
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:49,260
我想這就是為什么人們說如今
I guess that's why they call studying

364
00:12:49,260 --> 00:12:50,280
"學習如抽煙催人老"
"The new smoking."

365
00:12:50,660 --> 00:12:51,680
從沒有人這么說
No one says that.

366
00:12:51,700 --> 00:12:52,400
我能不能加一句
Can I add --

367
00:12:52,420 --> 00:12:54,220
你肯定能 但對現實世界又有什么幫助
I'm sure you can, but it won't help in the real world.

368
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,220
總之 多謝各位前來
Anyway, thank you all for coming.

369
00:12:56,380 --> 00:12:58,100
大家下午愉快 保重
Have a good afternoon. Take care.

370
00:12:58,454 --> 00:12:59,454
小卡 你搞什么
Cam, what the hell?

371
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:00,500
我學到了很多
I learned a lot.

372
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:02,540
塔克
Tucker!

373
00:13:03,253 --> 00:13:04,893
我在滴滴上沒接到客
I wasn't picking up a lot of Uber fares,

374
00:13:04,900 --> 00:13:06,060
所以我提前回來
so I came back here early

375
00:13:06,060 --> 00:13:07,680
聽到了你最后這段結尾
and I heard the end of your little presentation.

376
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,000
我知道你打的什么小算盤
I know what you're trying to do.

377
00:13:09,003 --> 00:13:11,383
我得和他談一下
Hey, I just need to talk to him for-for one second.

378
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:12,760
你猜怎么著
Hey, hey. Guess what.

379
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:15,240
我剛剛把小蛋糕送到上司家去了
I just dropped off the cupcakes at my boss's house.

380
00:13:15,633 --> 00:13:18,363
原來他沒把我想接的案子給我
Turns out he-he didn't give me the case I wanted

381
00:13:18,380 --> 00:13:20,260
是因為他有個更好的案子要給我
because he had an even better one for me.

382
00:13:20,463 --> 00:13:21,633
真的嗎 那太好了
Really? T-that's amazing.

383
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,040
而且他也不是要我做小蛋糕
And he didn't want me to make cupcakes.

384
00:13:23,060 --> 00:13:24,620
他只是想讓我推薦一個新承包商
He just wanted me to recommend a new caterer.

385
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:27,720
我們為此笑得前仰后合
So we had a big laugh about that.

386
00:13:27,923 --> 00:13:29,353
但這都證明了
But just goes to show,

387
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:30,700
別耍小把戲
don't play games.

388
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:32,420
做好你的工作 你就會得到認可
Do your job, and you'll be recognized.

389
00:13:32,503 --> 00:13:34,512
-是啊 可你說 -別管我說過什么
Yeah, but you said -- No, ah! Forget what I said.

390
00:13:34,512 --> 00:13:36,832
條條大路通羅馬
T-there's no one path to success.

391
00:13:36,900 --> 00:13:39,160
這才是你該教給孩子們的
I mean, that's what you should be telling these kids.

392
00:13:39,260 --> 00:13:41,040
是啊 我本來是想這么跟孩子們說的
Yeah, that's what I was going to tell these kids --

393
00:13:41,060 --> 00:13:41,560
去你的 塔克
Damn it, Tucker!

394
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:43,740
我的霸氣姿勢維持不了這么久
I can't hold my alpha power stance this long.

395
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:44,980
我的小腿要抽筋了
My calves are starting to cramp.

396
00:13:45,460 --> 00:13:46,820
好吧 首先
Okay, well, first of all --

397
00:13:46,820 --> 00:13:48,260
不 省省吧 明白嗎
No, can it! Okay?

398
00:13:48,460 --> 00:13:50,960
你以為能用低大學申請率埋葬我
You thought you could bury me by killing college applications,

399
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:51,500
是不是
didn't you?

400
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:54,260
我這就去收拾和別人共用的那半張桌子
I will clean out my half of the desk that I share.

401
00:13:54,372 --> 00:13:56,792
不 我很抱歉 這都是我的錯
Oh, no, it's -- I'm so sorry. T-this is-this is my fault.

402
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:58,880
我在工作上試著乖乖合作
I tried to play ball at work.

403
00:13:58,880 --> 00:14:00,720
還沒必要地烤了很多蛋糕
There was a lot of unnecessary baking.

404
00:14:01,902 --> 00:14:05,381
重點是 是我給了他這些想法 所以...
The point is, I-I put these ideas into his head, so...

405
00:14:05,860 --> 00:14:07,780
所以你如此軟弱 沒有信念
So you're so weak and without conviction

406
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:09,980
某人向你提議一些蠢主意
that somebody suggests some stupid idea to you

407
00:14:09,980 --> 00:14:12,900
你甚至不想想看 就拋棄所有價值觀
and without even thinking, you just abandon all your values

408
00:14:12,900 --> 00:14:14,820
像廉價的扇子一樣任憑人折來折去
and fold like a cheap Chinese fan, huh?

409
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,380
是的 先生 我是只應聲蟲
Yes, sir. I am a worm.

410
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:19,600
這正是我要找的特質
That is exactly what I'm looking for.

411
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:20,760
完全不會威脅到我
No threat to me at all.

412
00:14:21,100 --> 00:14:24,060
恭喜你 正式副校長塔克
Well, congratulations, permanent Vice Principal Tucker.

413
00:14:24,140 --> 00:14:24,940
-真的嗎 -真的
- Really? - Yes.

414
00:14:24,940 --> 00:14:26,040
謝謝您 我愛您
Thank you! I love you!

415
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:26,800
我也愛你
I love you, too.

416
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:29,340
當務之急 去彌補你剛才的過失
Now, first order of business -- fix what you did here.

417
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:31,420
你要為我摘下金蘋果
You are gonna give me a Golden Apple.

418
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:33,760
我們倆可是穩定伴侶
We are in a committed relationship!

419
00:14:33,820 --> 00:14:35,100
不不不 這不是一回事
No, no, no. It's not the same thing we saw at

420
00:14:35,100 --> 00:14:35,840
不是胡嬌單身漢派對上那種
Pepper's bachelor party.

421
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:36,840
-不是嗎 -不是
- It's not? - No.

422
00:14:38,180 --> 00:14:40,140
和所有人吵了一整天后
After fighting with everybody all day,

423
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:43,560
我開始思考 或許 是我犯渾了
I was starting to think maybe... I was the jerk.

424
00:14:44,500 --> 00:14:46,780
所以最后我回到老辦公室
So I ended up back at the old office, you know,

425
00:14:46,780 --> 00:14:50,180
試圖搞清楚我究竟是為什么
trying to figure out what it was about going to work there

426
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:52,190
熱愛去那里工作
that I loved so much.

427
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:56,100
恭喜
Congratulations.

428
00:14:56,580 --> 00:15:00,340
你被普里契特衣柜 百葉窗及水床雇用了
You've been hired at Pritchett's Closets, Blinds, and Waterbeds.

429
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:01,240
我是杰·普里契特
I'm Jay Pritchett.

430
00:15:01,880 --> 00:15:02,880
歡迎成為團隊一員
Welcome to the team.

431
00:15:03,480 --> 00:15:04,460
聽到了嗎
You hear that?

432
00:15:04,700 --> 00:15:06,020
他們已經在為你歡呼了
They're cheering for you already.

433
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:09,060
我們這里很珍視一個品質 那就是團隊合作
That's something we value here -- teamwork.

434
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:11,000
無論你是銷售部還是運輸部
And whether you're in sales or shipping

435
00:15:11,400 --> 00:15:13,700
或是可愛的文職人員之一
or one of those cute tomatoes in the steno pool,

436
00:15:13,940 --> 00:15:14,840
你都很重要
you're important,

437
00:15:15,459 --> 00:15:17,149
因為在這我們是一家人
'cause we're family here.

438
00:15:17,149 --> 00:15:19,859
等一下 這個新雇員是誰
Wait a minute! Who's this new employee?

439
00:15:19,880 --> 00:15:21,360
是我 克萊爾 爸爸
It's me -- Claire, Daddy.

440
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:23,420
沒錯 是克萊爾
Oh, right! It's Claire!

441
00:15:29,760 --> 00:15:30,720
手真靈巧
Nice hands.

442
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:33,620
難怪我們公司的壘球隊永遠贏不了球
Reminds me why our softball team never won a game.

443
00:15:33,880 --> 00:15:36,140
看看是誰從高級總部辦公室跑出來了
Look who they let out of the fancy corporate office.

444
00:15:36,189 --> 00:15:38,608
你老婆有沒有突然醒悟離你而去
Hey, that wife of yours get smart and leave you yet?

445
00:15:38,608 --> 00:15:40,988
她真的離我而去了 這段日子很艱難
Eh, actually, she did. It's been rough.

446
00:15:41,168 --> 00:15:42,718
我們不知道 我太抱歉了
Oh. I -- We didn't know. I'm so sorry.

447
00:15:42,718 --> 00:15:44,328
你們這些傻瓜 我逗你們玩的
Ah, you mutts, I'm screwing with you!

448
00:15:44,328 --> 00:15:45,459
她能去哪
Where's she going?

449
00:15:48,520 --> 00:15:50,600
我知道我爸心里有疙瘩
I knew my dad was going through something,

450
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:52,800
當我在舊辦公室看到他的車時
and when I saw his car at the old office,

451
00:15:52,808 --> 00:15:54,668
就過來確認他狀態如何
I-I stopped by to check on him.

452
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:55,980
你羞嗎 克萊爾
Are you feeling shy, Claire?

453
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:59,300
是啊 我想是有點
Yeah, I guess I am a little.

454
00:15:59,860 --> 00:16:01,000
你幾歲了
How old are you?

455
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:04,080
你說得對 我就直說了
You're right. Just come out and say it.

456
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:08,300
我擔心我們把公司賣了讓你不開心
I'm worried that you're unhappy we sold the company

457
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:09,220
并且你覺得這是我的錯
and you're blaming it on me.

458
00:16:09,480 --> 00:16:11,780
你又有你要去拉粑粑的那個表情了
You're making that face like you have to go potty.

459
00:16:12,540 --> 00:16:13,980
我很焦慮
I'm anxious and --

460
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:16,140
你怎么能看到我的表情啊
How can you even see my face?

461
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:17,620
她是我女兒
She's my daughter.

462
00:16:17,780 --> 00:16:19,780
她認為這里她說了算
She thinks she runs the place.

463
00:16:27,077 --> 00:16:28,387
你還說他不會干呢
You said he wouldn't do it.

464
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:29,740
沒錯 老子干了
You're damn right, I did it.

465
00:16:29,797 --> 00:16:31,457
老大永遠都是老大啊
Boss is still the best, huh?

466
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:35,300
老爸想"家"了
My dad was homesick.

467
00:16:36,607 --> 00:16:39,057
杰 你的屁股可真上相啊
That is one photogenic butt, Jay.

468
00:16:39,057 --> 00:16:41,326
你帶回家吧 讓你在家還能繼續拍馬屁
Take it with you. You can kiss it at home, too.

469
00:16:44,346 --> 00:16:45,706
-大家好啊 -你來啦
- Hey, guys. - Hey.

470
00:16:45,706 --> 00:16:47,506
-老爸 -你怎么來這里啦
- Hi, Dad. - Hey, what are you doing here?

471
00:16:47,506 --> 00:16:49,446
我看到你的車嘛
I, uh, saw your car.

472
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:50,300
聽我說
Look...

473
00:16:50,460 --> 00:16:52,760
我知道你最近在工作上有點不順心
I know you've been frustrated at work lately.

474
00:16:53,140 --> 00:16:54,220
不用擔心這個啦
Don't worry about that.

475
00:16:54,500 --> 00:16:55,760
但你新工作上挺順利的吧
You're doing great, though, huh?

476
00:16:56,516 --> 00:16:57,986
是啊 我還挺喜歡的
Yeah, I kind of love it.

477
00:16:58,020 --> 00:17:00,880
但我不能只顧自己不顧你啊
But it doesn't feel right if you hate it.

478
00:17:00,920 --> 00:17:03,220
老爸 這合作我們是可以甩頭就走的
Dad, we can bail on the whole thing.

479
00:17:03,280 --> 00:17:04,740
你知道我真正該甩開的是什么嗎
You know what I need to bail on?

480
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:07,340
是甩開像桃子般的自己
Being such a little peach.

481
00:17:08,060 --> 00:17:09,700
-什么 -一磕碰就壞嘛
- What? - They bruise easily.

482
00:17:09,860 --> 00:17:11,060
我記得有這種說法 但無所謂啦
It could be an expression. I don't know.

483
00:17:11,080 --> 00:17:13,280
重點是當我在這里時 我更能與人接觸
The point is, when I was here, I reached out more.

484
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:15,280
我錄了與別人問候的視頻
I made videos greeting people.

485
00:17:15,880 --> 00:17:17,160
建立起了真正的感情
I built real relationships.

486
00:17:17,320 --> 00:17:19,220
剛才那三個人 我能記住其中兩人的名字呢
Those three guys -- I knew two of their names.

487
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:22,780
我想或許我該試著多向你學習
I think maybe I need to try to be a little bit more like you

488
00:17:22,780 --> 00:17:24,160
給這個新合作一個機會
and give this new thing a chance.

489
00:17:24,795 --> 00:17:26,935
其實他們也沒那么糟啦 只要你習慣了...
You know, they're not so bad when you get past the --

490
00:17:27,205 --> 00:17:29,925
他們的嬉皮士胡子還有都是手汗的握手
the hipster beards and the sweaty handshakes.

491
00:17:29,925 --> 00:17:31,935
跟我說說那個打印男 愛德華多
Tell me about that printer guy, Eduardo.

492
00:17:31,935 --> 00:17:33,785
3D打印到底是什么鬼
What the hell is 3-D printing anyway?

493
00:17:33,785 --> 00:17:35,035
你在試著學習呢
Look at you trying.

494
00:17:35,035 --> 00:17:36,085
老爸
Oh, Dad!

495
00:17:36,085 --> 00:17:38,705
3D打印就是用三種激光
Okay, 3-D printing is when you take three lasers

496
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:40,560
你可以掃描任何你想要的事物
and you can scan any object you want.

497
00:17:40,565 --> 00:17:41,455
然后...
You --

498
00:17:41,455 --> 00:17:42,955
你想3D打印你的屁股對吧
You want to 3-D print your butt, don't you?

499
00:17:42,980 --> 00:17:44,540
你想要他們喜歡我不是嗎
We want them to like me, don't we?

500
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:48,760
好了 寶貝跟小伙伴玩得開心
Okay, baby, have fun at your play date.

501
00:17:48,820 --> 00:17:49,960
我兩小時后來接你
I'll pick you up in two hours.

502
00:17:50,860 --> 00:17:53,220
你能相信我現在是個模特了嗎
Can you believe I'm a model now?

503
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:54,880
瘋狂世界啊
Crazy world.

504
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:55,760
再見啦 小伙子
See you, buddy.

505
00:17:55,944 --> 00:17:58,224
-寶貝再見 -媽媽再見
- Bye, baby. - Bye, Mom!

506
00:17:58,640 --> 00:18:00,380
天啊 我真為這孩子高興
Gosh, I'm so happy for that kid.

507
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,260
是啊 我們一直這么說
Yeah, we keep saying that.

508
00:18:03,414 --> 00:18:05,544
我覺得自己好傻啊
I feel, uh, silly I got so invested

509
00:18:05,544 --> 00:18:08,504
為永遠不會有人看到的商場海報投入靈魂
in modeling for some mall poster no one's ever gonna see.

510
00:18:08,754 --> 00:18:10,144
你想感覺好一些嗎
You want to feel better?

511
00:18:10,304 --> 00:18:11,894
我帶你去看個東西 看完之后
I'll show you something that is gonna make me

512
00:18:12,160 --> 00:18:14,180
我保證會比你更顯可悲
look more pathetic than you do.

513
00:18:14,264 --> 00:18:15,924
我說的只是"傻"吧 但...
I think I said "silly," But, um...

514
00:18:16,380 --> 00:18:17,340
行啊
yeah, okay.

515
00:18:20,740 --> 00:18:22,600
那是我20年前拍的
That was me 20 years ago.

516
00:18:23,380 --> 00:18:24,340
很棒啊
That's amazing.

517
00:18:25,413 --> 00:18:26,853
所以你不開心的原因是什么啊
But what are you so upset about?

518
00:18:26,853 --> 00:18:29,093
你現在還是跟當年一樣美啊
You're just as beautiful now as you were then.

519
00:18:29,663 --> 00:18:30,754
我知道啦
Aww. I know.

520
00:18:30,883 --> 00:18:32,763
只是我會想起那段時光
It's just that it was a time in my life

521
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,820
我曾在外面坑蒙拐騙
where I was out there hustling,

522
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:38,040
當模特 開出租
modeling, driving a taxi,

523
00:18:38,280 --> 00:18:41,380
在夜店外面賣培根卷熱狗
selling bacon-wrapped hot dogs outside a nightclub.

524
00:18:42,320 --> 00:18:45,120
看到他們把那廣告拆下來
Seeing them taking it down made me feel like

525
00:18:45,143 --> 00:18:48,252
令我感到那時的我要永遠消失了
that version of me is gone forever.

526
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:50,240
因此你又想要開始模特生涯
So that's why you wanted to start modeling again.

527
00:18:50,542 --> 00:18:54,222
我只是想念對某件事物很有激情的感覺
I just miss being passionate about something again.

528
00:18:54,300 --> 00:18:56,380
就像你對房地產一樣的激情
The way that you feel passionate about real estate.

529
00:18:56,712 --> 00:18:58,942
你總是看起來很... 很有活力
Mm. You always seem, like, so alive,

530
00:18:58,942 --> 00:19:01,592
做成新買賣 認識新的人
making new deals, meeting new people.

531
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:04,400
你有想過來當房地產中介嗎
Have you ever thought about becoming a Realtor?

532
00:19:05,140 --> 00:19:06,940
-誰沒想過啊 -這倒是真的
- Who hasn't? - That's true.

533
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:10,120
我有次曾買過一本書來學怎么做這行
I bought a book one time to learn how to do it,

534
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:11,880
但你也懂后來怎么樣了
but you know how it is.

535
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:14,100
有時候人生就是會卡在一個瓶頸
Sometimes in life, you just get stuck.

536
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,920
我覺得你很適合這行呢 真的
I think you'd be great at it. Really.

537
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:18,580
我會愿意買任何你賣的東西
I'd buy anything from you.

538
00:19:18,660 --> 00:19:20,240
我現在都在考慮去漂白我的牙了呢
I'm thinking about getting my chompers bleached,

539
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:21,620
那還只是剩下一半的你的廣告牌呢
and there's only half of you up there.

540
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:22,740
-真的嗎 -真的
- Really? - Yeah.

541
00:19:24,040 --> 00:19:26,980
問自己下一步該走向哪其實挺令人恐懼
It can be scary to ask yourself what's next.

542
00:19:26,980 --> 00:19:30,340
心里會浮現所有對自己的質疑
All the doubts start to creep in.

543
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:32,580
別人會喜歡我嗎
Are people going to like me?

544
00:19:33,360 --> 00:19:34,440
還好燙[火辣]啊
Ooh, still hot.

545
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:35,440
謝謝夸獎
Thank you!

546
00:19:35,820 --> 00:19:38,960
我每周都會找幾天在后院健健身
I throw a tractor tire around the backyard a couple days a week.

547
00:19:40,460 --> 00:19:42,380
我能克服困難嗎
Can I handle the challenge?

548
00:19:45,460 --> 00:19:46,060
兄弟
Dude.

549
00:19:49,300 --> 00:19:51,720
你可以不停地對自己提出質疑
You can ask these questions forever,

550
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:54,580
但你也可以踏出第一步
or you can just take the first step.

551
00:19:54,580 --> 00:19:58,140
所有的房屋開放日都有這五點檢查要素
Here is your five-point checklist for any open house.

552
00:19:58,300 --> 00:19:59,060
第一點
Number one --

553
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:02,660
抱歉 教授
Sorry, professor.

554
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:09,400
菲爾 親愛的 你來這里做什么呢
Phil, honey. What are you doing here?

555
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:11,780
我來給你個驚喜 順便約你去吃晚飯嘛
Hey. I thought I'd surprise you and take you out to dinner.

556
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:15,080
突發奇想 你知道我就喜歡這樣
Spontaneous. You know I like that.

557
00:20:15,220 --> 00:20:17,260
我先去確認一下大家都走了沒
Well, um, let me just make sure everybody's gone.

558
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:18,240
拿上我的包就可以鎖門了
I'll grab my bag and lock up.

559
00:20:18,310 --> 00:20:19,291
沒問題
Awesome.

560
00:20:22,840 --> 00:20:25,660
我能對你的服裝提供協助嗎[幫你脫衣服]
May I help you with your clothes?

561
00:20:27,260 --> 00:20:29,360
看來這里真的只剩下我們了
I guess we are the only ones here.

562
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:32,140
或許我們先從褲子開始吧
Perhaps we'll start with the pants.

563
00:20:34,069 --> 00:20:35,570
通常你都是喜歡...
Normally, you like a little...

564
00:20:35,739 --> 00:20:37,259
慢慢解開襯衫扣子的
...slow shirt unbuttoning,

565
00:20:37,259 --> 00:20:41,009
但看來今天我們... 要直搗黃龍啦
but I guess we... are cutting to the chase.

566
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:45,000
爸 你還在找地方放你的屁股嗎
Dad. Are you still looking for a place to leave that butt?

567
00:20:45,080 --> 00:20:45,800
真的好惡心
It's so gross.

568
00:20:45,899 --> 00:20:48,029
論建立辦公室情誼
There's nothing better for office comradery

569
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:49,140
沒有比惡作劇更棒的方法了
than a practical joke.

570
00:20:49,209 --> 00:20:51,119
能振奮人心呢
It lifts people' spirits.

571
00:20:56,318 --> 00:20:57,389
我輸了
Well played.
